WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:04.462
[Crowd chanting:] Kobe!
Kobe! Kobe!

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:07.674
- The passing,
the way guys reacted to it—

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.758
- I'm still in shock.

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:10.677
- When that happened that day,

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.137
it seemed like
the world stopped.

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:14.889
- To have it happen
so tragically,

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:17.600
it was one of those moments
that I think shook the world.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.144
- It's terribly sad,
what happened,

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:21.229
but, you know,
his memory's gonna live on,

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:22.731
not just through basketball,
but, you know,

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:25.650
through the people
he brought into this game.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.027
- Welcome to the Kobe Show.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.903
- [Announcer:]
Bryant to the basket.

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:30.739
Inside. Oh, what a finish.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.907
- [Announcer:] Kobe. Oh!

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:34.909
- [Announcer:]
What a reverse by Kobe Bryant.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:36.745
- The fiercest
of all competitors.

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:38.538
- He was a superhero
on the basketball court.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.707
- [Announcer:] One of the best
players to ever lace it up.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.417
- Back-to-back-to-back.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.502
- [Announcer:]
Five NBA titles, an MVP.

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:47.505
- He brought his own style,
his own mindset to the game.

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:49.799
- He never took a night off.
He competed every possession.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:51.176
- Made people who hated him

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:52.719
spend a lot of money
to come watch him.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.095
So that's when you know
you're great.

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:56.973
[Buzzer sounding]

00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:58.808
- [Announcer:]
He is hard to believe.

00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:00.351
- The biggest
thing that everybody, you know,

00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:02.187
admired about Kobe
was the competitiveness.

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:04.189
- An all-time winner
that represented the toughness,

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:05.982
the "play through everything"
type of mindset.

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:07.817
- Take big shots,
make big shots.

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:09.152
- He was one
of the hardest-working guys

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:10.528
that you ever wanted
to meet.

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:11.905
- I've never seen anybody
work like that.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.406
- I felt like
he was just invincible.

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.158
- That's Kobe Bryant.

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:18.161
- [Announcer:] There we go.
Here comes Kobe. Slam dunk.

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:20.580
- [Announcer:]
Kobe with a sick move in the lane.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.583
- [Announcer:] Wow.
Did you see the move by the kid?

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.376
That's Kobe.
- Whoo!

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:27.128
- [Announcer:]
He's putting on a show.

00:01:27.128 --> 00:01:29.172
- [Announcer:] 360 turn.
Slam.

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:30.673
- [Announcer:]
Giant slam dunk.

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:32.550
- [Announcer:]
What a move by Kobe.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.594
- 8 Kobe was the 
swaggy Kobe.

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:36.179
- Young, athletic,
kind of fun.

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:37.680
- Wear a chain, dunk on you,

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.349
throw lobs to Shaq.

00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:41.810
- [Announcer:] Bryant to Shaq.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:43.353
- Favorite Kobe moment—

00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:44.604
- We were playing
the Denver Nuggets.

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.939
I would yell out,
"Watch the press,"

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.357
and he would look at me,

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:49.109
and the smile would
come over his face

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.902
cuz he knew I saw something.

00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:53.029
- He got the full-court pass
and wrapped it behind his back

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:55.115
and did the reverse dunk.

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:58.368
- [Announcer:] Oh!
What'd I just see?

00:01:58.368 --> 00:02:00.495
- I was like, "See?
Listen to me.

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:02.205
I'll take you places."
[Chuckling]

00:02:02.205 --> 00:02:03.957
- Favorite moment
from Kobe's career—

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:05.792
I remember watching
the right-elbow pull-up

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.127
against the Phoenix Suns.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.879
- [Announcer:]
Bryant for the win. Bang!

00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:12.549
- Kobe No. 8 would shoot
27 times this quarter,

00:02:12.549 --> 00:02:14.092
"If I gotta win this game."

00:02:14.092 --> 00:02:16.261
- [Announcer:] Kobe Bryant
pulls up with a shot

00:02:16.261 --> 00:02:19.722
and hits the basket
with 2.6 to go.

00:02:19.722 --> 00:02:21.349
- Obviously remember
the 81-point game.

00:02:21.349 --> 00:02:24.352
- He had 81 points
in the game.

00:02:24.352 --> 00:02:26.479
- [Announcer:] He pump-fakes for two.
Kobe's got the Laker record!

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.064
- Players talk about
being in the zone.

00:02:28.064 --> 00:02:30.108
He was in the super zone.
He could not miss.

00:02:30.108 --> 00:02:31.484
- [Announcer:]
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.611
you have witnessed
the second-greatest

00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:36.406
scoring performance
in NBA history.

00:02:36.406 --> 00:02:37.740
- I just remember thinking

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:38.867
that it wasn't even real.

00:02:38.867 --> 00:02:40.201
It was amazing to watch.

00:02:40.201 --> 00:02:41.619
- [Announcer:]
Bryant on the pull-up.

00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:43.079
Puts it in.

00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:46.916
The Lakers repeat,
back-to-back titles.

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:49.169
Bryant, the drive.
Oh-ho!

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:52.088
Kobe Bryant on a rack attack.

00:02:52.088 --> 00:02:54.257
Double punch reverse.

00:02:54.257 --> 00:02:57.260
Oh! Yes!

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:00.305
- [Announcer:]
Sweet stuff by No. 24.

00:03:00.305 --> 00:03:02.432
- No. 24 was
a lot more determined.

00:03:02.432 --> 00:03:04.392
- He was locked in,
he was focused.

00:03:04.392 --> 00:03:06.561
- That real alpha
who’s not taking any prisoners.

00:03:06.561 --> 00:03:08.354
- My favorite Kobe moment—

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.148
Matt Barnes
was taking the ball to bounce,

00:03:10.148 --> 00:03:11.900
and he faked a pass-and-bounce
at Kobe's face,

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.194
and he didn't flinch,
blink or anything.

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:15.904
- That's when he turned into

00:03:15.904 --> 00:03:18.740
a basketball genius
and became unstoppable.

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.450
- [Announcer:] Back to Bryant.
Is he gonna try another one?

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.203
He is. Yes!

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:25.914
He's on fire, the "Mamba."

00:03:25.914 --> 00:03:29.417
- Mamba mentality is
a real laser-sharp focus,

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:31.377
showing up every day,
willing to work.

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:34.255
- [Announcer:] Kobe slithers.
Mamba.

00:03:34.255 --> 00:03:36.549
- It's a level
of relentlessness,

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:39.719
passion, work ethic
that's just unmatched.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:42.013
- That's what mambas do.
They don't back down.

00:03:42.013 --> 00:03:43.765
- At the end of the day,
what it allowed him to do

00:03:43.765 --> 00:03:46.392
was will himself
and will his team

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:47.936
to victories,
to championships.

00:03:47.936 --> 00:03:50.271
It was almost 
superhuman.

00:03:50.271 --> 00:03:53.149
- [Announcer:] That is just
greatness personified.

00:03:53.149 --> 00:03:54.609
- A lotta people love Kobe.

00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:56.694
- Kobe was a leader of our game,

00:03:56.694 --> 00:03:58.571
- [Announcer:]
Inspired a whole generation
of basketball players.

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:00.448
- He was someone
that everyone looks up to,

00:04:00.448 --> 00:04:03.034
especially this generation
of players.

00:04:03.034 --> 00:04:06.120
- So in the words
of Kobe Bryant, "Mamba out,"

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.582
but in the words of us,
“Not forgotten.” Live on, brother.

00:04:09.582 --> 00:04:12.168
- Kobe's impact on the league
is extraordinary.

00:04:12.168 --> 00:04:14.629
- He's definitely one of the most
inspirational basketball players

00:04:14.629 --> 00:04:16.172
I ever grew up watching.

00:04:16.172 --> 00:04:18.258
- He made it OK to be 
obsessed with basketball

00:04:18.258 --> 00:04:20.760
and to just put everything
you had into the game.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.804
- For him
to just have the mindset

00:04:22.804 --> 00:04:24.347
of wanting to help others

00:04:24.347 --> 00:04:26.516
and the younger generation
was really special.

00:04:26.516 --> 00:04:28.518
- He's a role model
for so many kids.

00:04:28.518 --> 00:04:30.144
He's like their Superman.

00:04:30.144 --> 00:04:31.980
- He was our
generation's Michael Jordan.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.898
- We are now
the people carrying the torch,

00:04:33.898 --> 00:04:36.567
and we're influenced
very heavily by his play

00:04:36.567 --> 00:04:38.194
and his mentality.

00:04:38.194 --> 00:04:39.904
- The game will forever
be indebted to him.

00:04:39.904 --> 00:04:42.407
[Crowd chanting:] Kobe!
Kobe! Kobe! Kobe! Kobe!

00:04:42.407 --> 00:04:49.038
♪♪♪

